  "mn57:0.2": "<p>See also: <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn135'>MN 135</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn136'>MN 136</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.233'>AN 4:233</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.235'>AN 4:235</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.237'>AN 4:237</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.238'>AN 4:238</a></p><p>This is the title of this sutta in the Thai edition of the Canon. In other editions, the title is: Kukkuravatika Sutta—The Dog-Practice Ascetic.</p>",
